      "visibleText": "0 Home About Us ERP Modules Industries Grants Customers Contact Us Singapore Grants Information Home Grants Information GRANT SUPPORT AVAILABLE Below are some Singapore government grants that are available to eligible SMEs for digital transformation purchases and implementations. Globe3 ERP is listed as a pre-approved PSG ERP software solution . Productivity Solutions Grant / PSG Eligibility Criteria Business registered and incorporated in Singapore Minimum 30% local shareholding Group annual sales turnover of not more than S$100 million Group employment size of not more than 200 workers Grant Funding Amount SMEs are eligible for up to 50% Productivity Solutions Grant (PSG) support for the adoption of Globe3 ERP, a Pre-Approved Solution under the IMDA SMEs Go Digital programme. Click to purchase Grant Packages Enterprise Development Grant / EDG Eligibility Criteria Business registered and incorporated in Singapore Minimum 30% local shareholding Proven business financial track record Grant Funding Amount Enterprise Development Grant can provide funding of up to 50% of qualifying project costs, including consultant service fees, software and equipment, and internal manpower cost. Skills Future Enterprise Credit / SFEC Eligibility Criteria Business registered and incorporated in Singapore Minimum 30% local shareholding Employed minimum 3 Singapore citizens or permanent residents over qualifying period Grant Funding Amount See below link for latest grant info: https://www.myskillsfuture.gov.sg/content/portal/en Need An ERP Solution? If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us and we will get back to you shortly. Contact Us Our company has been developing enterprise intelligent solutions for over 10 years. As a locally-based firm, all our solutions are developed by our group's in-house R&D teams with emphasis on local and regional business requirements. Contact Information TNO Systems Pte Ltd 10 Kallang Ave, Aperia Tower 2, #05-15, Singapore 339510 (65) 6749-8823 (65) 8060 9925 (Whatsapp) enquiry@globe3.com Sitemap Home About Us Customers ERP Modules Industries Grants Contact Us Quick Links Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Our Socials Facebook 𝕏 Twitter LinkedIn YouTube Supported by Copyright © 2025 TNO Systems Pte Ltd. All rights reserved.",
